'''Cool in the Heat''' (暑い日も涼しく, ''Atsui Hi mo Suzushiku'', '''Cool Even on Hot Days''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

